{"text":"In five years, we formulated the laws and policies and strategies for growth and development. We removed the international sanctions on our primary exports, introduced and made public a cash-based budget, increased revenue by over 400%, and mobilized foreign direct investment and worked 16 times the size of the economy when I assumed office. We built a small professional army in Coast Guard, moved the economy from negative growth to average annual 6%. We have virtually eliminated a 4.9 billion external debt, settled a large portion of international institutional debt, and re-crafted domestic barriers and suppliers' credit. Moreover, we restored electricity and pipe-horned water lacking in our capital for two decades, reconstructed to modern universities.","words":[{"text":"In","start":0.0,"end":0.6},{"text":"five","start":0.6,"end":0.9},{"text":"years","start":0.9,"end":1.34,"punct":","},{"text":"we","start":2.24,"end":2.56},{"text":"formulated","start":2.56,"end":3.1},{"text":"the","start":3.1,"end":3.4},{"text":"laws","start":3.4,"end":3.72},{"text":"and","start":3.72,"end":3.96},{"text":"policies","start":3.96,"end":4.44},{"text":"and","start":4.44,"end":4.7},{"text":"strategies","start":4.7,"end":5.12},{"text":"for","start":5.12,"end":5.46},{"text":"growth","start":5.46,"end":5.72},{"text":"and","start":5.72,"end":5.9},{"text":"development","start":5.9,"end":6.4,"punct":"."},{"text":"We","start":7.44,"end":7.64},{"text":"removed","start":7.64,"end":8.04},{"text":"the","start":8.04,"end":8.26},{"text":"international","start":8.26,"end":8.78},{"text":"sanctions","start":8.78,"end":9.32},{"text":"on","start":9.32,"end":9.6},{"text":"our","start":9.6,"end":9.78},{"text":"primary","start":9.78,"end":10.16},{"text":"exports","start":10.16,"end":10.98,"punct":","},{"text":"introduced","start":11.86,"end":12.4},{"text":"and","start":12.4,"end":12.7},{"text":"made","start":12.7,"end":12.94},{"text":"public","start":12.94,"end":13.3},{"text":"a","start":13.3,"end